 already an element of $A$.","$A$ must be the empty set.","$B$ must contain no elements of $A$."],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"fa96050a0566a659a3e8f471","time_limit":30},{"id":"union_of_sets_new_curated20261026_008","difficulty":"basic","question_type":"conceptual","question":"Which relation holds for every pair of sets $A,B$?","options":["$A\\subseteq A\\cup B$","$A\\cup B\\subseteq A$","$A=A\\cup B$ for all $B$","$A$ and $A\\cup B$ are disjoint"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"2592a81952efd8407b6739f9","time_limit":25},{"id":"union_of_sets_new_curated20261026_009","difficulty":"basic","question_type":"application","question":"Which formula for $|A\\cup B|$ holds for every pair of finite sets $A,B$?","options":["$|A|+|B|-|A\\cap B|$","$|A|+|B|$","$|A|\\cdot|B|$","$|A|-|B|$"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"7e2d3581d676095d89b44559","time_limit":20},{"id":"union_of_sets_new_curated20261026_010","difficulty":"standard","question_type":"conceptual","question":"When does $A\\cup B=A\\cap B$ hold?","options":["Exactly when $A=B$","For all sets $A,B$","Only when both are empty","Never"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"7d12287d80d4755fa44829f5","time_limit":30},{"id":"union_of_sets_new_curated20261026_011","difficulty":"basic","question_type":"application","question":"If $|A|=3$, $|B|=4$, and $|A\\cap B|=1$, what is $|A\\cup B|$?","options":["$6$","$7$","$8$","$5$"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"bea59f703d98dc3e21a35ec8","time_limit":20},{"id":"union_of_sets_new_curated20261026_012","difficulty":"basic","question_type":"application","question":"What is $\\{1,2\\}\\cup\\{1,2\\}$?","options":["$\\{1,2\\}$","$\\{\\{1,2\\}\\}$","$\\varnothing$","$\\{1\\}$"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"7cafd257b6ab941ba7a1c9d5","time_limit":20}]}}